    "text": "By 7 News Staff ,\n6 hours ago FORT DRUM, New York (WWNY) - A new campus-style dining venue is set to open at Fort Drum on Thursday. The Belvedere Bistro will offer a university-style food court experience with multiple food stations, including grilled salmon and chicken, rotating global cuisine, pizza and pasta, wraps and sandwiches, and smoothies and shakes. Read full article",
